title: [+ kwasniewski_reproach_title +]
subtitle: A studio has booked the former president, and the subject of the interview is us.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 45
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and kwasniewski_channel = 1 and kwasniewski_estranged = 0 and kwasniewski_alignment < 40 and kwasniewski_card_timer <= 0
card-image: img/poland/cards/kwasniewski-reproach.webp
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.kwasniewski_card_timer = 7;
Q.kwasniewski_reproach_count += 1;
Q.kwasniewski_standing = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.kwasniewski_standing) || 0) - 1
);
// The interview has already happened. The card is the response to it, so the
// base damage lands here and the choices decide only how much of it we get
// back. Mitigation is deliberately expensive; the free answers are not free.
const charge = String(Q.kwasniewski_charge || "tvn");
if (charge == "konf") {
    Q.public_trust -= 6;
    Q.ko_relation -= 8;
    Q.p2050_relation -= 4;
    Q.psl_relation -= 3;
    Q.urban_progressive_support -= 5;
    Q.progressive_credibility -= 5;
    Q.institutional_trust -= 3;
    Q.eu_left_network -= 3;
    // A hard legitimacy penalty with the democratic camp, and a real if
    // smaller gain with the electorate that despises it.
    Q.rural_support += 2;
    Q.social_patriot_support += 3;
    Q.anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 2;
    Q.kwasniewski_verdict =
        "Told the country in public that Lewica cannot govern with the radical right";
} else if (charge == "road") {
    Q.public_trust -= 4;
    Q.urban_progressive_support -= 5;
    Q.pensioner_support -= 3;
    Q.ko_relation -= 5;
    Q.progressive_credibility -= 3;
    Q.barons_dissent += 5;
    Q.kwasniewski_verdict =
        "Told the leadership, on the record, not to go down this road";
} else if (charge == "institutions") {
    Q.local_network -= 4;
    Q.media_access -= 3;
    Q.institutional_trust -= 4;
    Q.negotiation_capital = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.negotiation_capital) || 0) - 3
    );
    Q.barons_dissent += 5;
    if ((Number(Q.resources) || 0) >= 1) Q.resources -= 1;
    Q.kwasniewski_verdict =
        "Withdrew from a party he says no longer respects the institutions he built";
} else if (charge == "different_left") {
    Q.party_unity -= 5;
    Q.progressives_dissent += 5;
    Q.barons_dissent += 5;
    Q.pps_dissent += 3;
    Q.left_poll -= 0.2;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.kwasniewski_verdict =
        "Began appearing alongside dissident social democrats instead of the party";
} else if (charge == "concerns") {
    Q.public_trust -= 4;
    Q.media_access -= 4;
    Q.media_capacity -= 2;
    Q.winner_reputation -= 3;
    Q.kwasniewski_reproach_debt += 1;
    Q.kwasniewski_verdict =
        "Expressed concerns, and every interviewer in Poland now opens with them";
} else {
    Q.urban_progressive_support -= 4;
    Q.media_capacity -= 2;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.progressive_credibility -= 2;
    Q.left_poll -= 0.2;
    Q.kwasniewski_verdict =
        "Said it on TVN, and metropolitan voters heard it";
}
Q.news_headline = "Kwaśniewski goes on television, and the subject is us";
!}

# The hostile Kwaśniewski deck. Rarer than the aligned one, and it arrives with
# its damage already applied — the interview is not something the player can
# prevent, only answer. The face is selected in poland_normalize from the
# specific thing he has decided to object to.

= [+ kwasniewski_reproach_title +]

[? if kwasniewski_frame = "primacy": It is the season of the Tribunal and the
treaties, and there is no living Pole better qualified to be asked about them
on television.?]
[? if kwasniewski_frame = "war": There is a war on the eastern border, which
means the foreign desks have him on speed dial and the domestic desks get him
on the way out.?]
[? if kwasniewski_frame = "count": It is the year the opposition has to count,
and he is the only person in the studio who has ever actually won.?]
[? if kwasniewski_frame = "repair": The institutions are being repaired in
public, and his signature is on the document being repaired.?]
[? if kwasniewski_frame = "palace": It is a presidential year. He is on
television regardless of what anyone does.?]
[? if kwasniewski_frame = "third_winter": It is the coalition's third winter,
the season in which retired statesmen are invited to assess governments.?]
[? if kwasniewski_frame = "election_year": It is an election year, and every
studio in the country is filling airtime with people who used to hold power.?]
[? if kwasniewski_frame = "aftermath": It is the long flat month after a
national vote, when the studios have airtime and nothing to fill it with.?]

**Aleksander Kwaśniewski** has been booked for eleven minutes and uses nine of
them on us.

[? if kwasniewski_charge = "konf": He is asked about the arrangement with the
radical right, and he does not hedge. He says he negotiated the accession
treaty with people whose successors now sit in that club; that he knows what
they intend to do with the courts and the border; and that there is no welfare
programme large enough to make the trade rational. **You cannot govern with
them**, he says, and it is the clip of the week.?]
[? if kwasniewski_charge = "road": He uses the phrase deliberately, knowing
exactly what it will be compared to. *Nie idźcie tą drogą.* He says the party
he helped build is being replaced by something that shares its name and none of
its commitments, and that he is saying so now because in two years it will be
too late for saying things to matter.?]
[? if kwasniewski_charge = "institutions": He is measured, which is worse than
angry. He says that the constitution he signed is being treated as an
inconvenience, that he does not intend to spend his retirement defending people
who do that, and that he has declined several invitations. Within a fortnight
the declining spreads: former ministers, foundation boards, two provincial
notables and a donor who has given to every left campaign since 1997.?]
[? if kwasniewski_charge = "different_left": He appears at a panel alongside
three social democrats who left our party, a Brussels foundation director and
one visibly delighted former minister. Nobody announces anything. The
photograph does the work, and inside a party already arguing with itself it
does a great deal of it.?]
[? if kwasniewski_charge = "concerns": The title of the segment is *the former
president has concerns*, and the concerns are expressed so mildly that the
first reaction in our press office is relief. The relief lasts until Thursday,
by which point every interviewer in the country has discovered that the fastest
way to make our spokesman uncomfortable is to ask whether Kwaśniewski had a
point.?]
[? if kwasniewski_charge = "tvn": He says it on TVN, in the slot the
metropolitan electorate actually watches, and the mechanical damage is not
enormous. What it does is take a doubt those voters already had and give it a
name they respect.?]

The party's verdict on the party is now: **[+ kwasniewski_verdict +]**.

- @reproach_flat
- @reproach_answer
- @reproach_silence


@reproach_flat
title: Send the deputy chair to his flat, tonight, with something to concede
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. The only route that recovers most of this. He will not accept an explanation; he wants a change he can point at.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Buying back a former president's goodwill costs two resources we do not have.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
Q.kwasniewski_standing += 2;
Q.kwasniewski_alignment_bias += 6;
Q.kwasniewski_reproach_debt = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.kwasniewski_reproach_debt) || 0) - 1
);
Q.public_trust += 3;
Q.ko_relation += 4;
Q.p2050_relation += 2;
Q.urban_progressive_support += 3;
Q.institutional_trust += 2;
Q.media_access += 2;
Q.progressive_credibility += 1;
Q.barons_dissent += 3;
Q.progressives_dissent += 2;
Q.razem_dissent += 3;
Q.party_unity -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica concedes ground in private and a former president stops giving interviews about it";
!}

The deputy chair goes to the flat the same evening, and it is not a
conversation about presentation. He has watched this manoeuvre attempted on him
by two prime ministers and is not interested in being managed; he wants
something he can point at when the next interviewer asks whether he was right.

We give him one. It costs a commitment we would rather not have made in public,
in front of factions who will now spend a month asking who authorised it. The
interviews stop within the week, the tone of the coverage turns, and the
question of whether our own leadership can be leaned on from outside is now
established fact rather than speculation.

- #poland_card_finish


@reproach_answer
title: Answer him in public and let the party enjoy it
subtitle: Free, popular internally, and it extends the story by a week. Our own base hardens; the voters he was speaking to hear a party arguing with its own founder.
on-arrival: {!
Q.kwasniewski_alignment_bias -= 5;
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.party_unity += 3;
Q.organiser_energy += 2;
Q.young_support += 1;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.progressives_dissent -= 2;
Q.razem_dissent -= 2;
Q.public_trust -= 2;
Q.urban_progressive_support -= 2;
Q.ko_relation -= 3;
Q.pensioner_support -= 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica answers a former president in public and keeps the argument running another week";
!}

We answer, and the answer is good: the Iraq deployment, the church financing,
the assets his governments sold, the party he left in ruins in 2005. Every word
of it is true and our organisers circulate it for days.

It also keeps him on television for another week, arguing back, on a subject
of his choosing, with his framing, in front of an electorate that has now
watched the Polish left conduct a public argument about the Polish left. The
people we needed to reassure are not reassured. The people who were already
with us are delighted.

- #poland_card_finish


@reproach_silence
title: Say nothing and wait for the news cycle to move
subtitle: Free. Costs no political capital now and compounds: the charge goes unanswered, and the next time he speaks he will be speaking to a record.
on-arrival: {!
Q.kwasniewski_alignment_bias -= 3;
Q.kwasniewski_reproach_debt += 1;
Q.public_trust -= 3;
Q.media_access -= 2;
Q.winner_reputation -= 2;
Q.list_confidence -= 2;
Q.urban_progressive_support -= 2;
Q.ko_relation -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica declines to respond to a former president, and the charge stands";
!}

The press office declines to comment, the leadership takes no questions on it,
and the cycle does move, because cycles do.

What does not move is the file. The charge is now on the record without a
Lewica answer beside it, which means the next interviewer can open with it as
established background rather than as an allegation, and the one after that can
open with the fact that we have never answered. This is the cheapest option
available and it is the only one that makes the next occasion worse.

- #poland_card_finish
